  "title": "How to control using DTM commands (not HCI / ACI)",
  "content": "<p>I want to use the 2-wire Direct Test Mode defined in Bluetooth Core Spec Vol. 6 Part F for RF testing of my STM32WBA custom board.</p><p>I've already tried BLE_TransparentMode. While HCI / ACI commands work, DTM commands don't respond.</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/4d387457-320d-40ff-9a42-bedc7d5e5766.png\" /></figure><p>Is it impossible to control with 2-wire DTM commands in BLE_TransparentMode?</p><p>Please let me know if there's any way to do this.</p>",
